@startuml
' SSD – UC-12: Write Review
title SSD – UC-12: Write Review

actor "Buyer" as Buyer
participant "SmartTech System" as System

== Select Product to Review ==

Buyer -> System: 1: viewDeliveredOrders()
activate System

System --> Buyer: 2: returnDeliveredOrdersList()

Buyer -> System: 3: selectProductToReview(orderId, productId)

alt already reviewed
    System --> Buyer: 4: returnMessage('Review already submitted for this product')
end

== Submit Review ==

Buyer -> System: 5: submitReview(rating, title, body, photos)

System -> System: 6: validateReviewContent(body length 20-500)

alt inappropriate content / profanity
    System --> Buyer: 7: returnContentError('Review contains prohibited content')
else content valid
    System -> System: 8: saveReview(status='PendingModeration')
    System -> System: 9: recalculateProductAverageRating(listingId)
    System --> Buyer: 10: returnReviewConfirmation()
end

deactivate System

@enduml